// Dependency call breakdown, last 1 hour.
// Table: dependencies - populated from CLIENT-kind Activities. Two distinct sources feed this
// table in this app, both automatic (see Observability/TelemetryExtensions.cs's header comment):
//   - EntityFrameworkCore instrumentation: every SQL command QuotesDbContext issues
//     (type == "SQL" once run against real Azure SQL - locally against SQLite it's "SQL" too,
//     but `name`/`target` reflect SQLite's own db.name, which is literally "main" - see
//     README "A real, honest surprise: SQLite's db.name is 'main'").
//   - The Azure SDK's own built-in tracing for Azure.Messaging.ServiceBus (captured via the
//     "Azure.*" ActivitySource wildcard, zero custom instrumentation code) - Send/Receive/Process
//     calls against the quote-events topic.
// INTERNAL-kind spans (this app's own custom "outbox.relay" span - see
// Observability/QuotesApiActivitySource.cs) land here too, tagged type == "InProc" - the
// worker-hop half of the "API -> worker -> DB" story this piece needs to prove.
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(1h)
| summarize
    callCount = count(),
    failedCount = countif(success == false),
    avgMs = round(avg(duration), 2),
    p95Ms = percentile(duration, 95)
    by type, target, name
| extend failureRatePercent = round(100.0 * failedCount / callCount, 2)
| order by callCount desc
